  "description": "Solid rocket motor design and manufacturing: composite propellant formulation (ammonium perchlorate oxidizer, aluminum fuel, HTPB binder), grain geometry for tailored thrust profiles, case bonding (filament-wound composite or steel), and ablative nozzle fabrication (carbon-carbon throats, phenolic liners). Delivers 250-285 s Isp with thrust from kilonewtons to 16 MN, enabling strap-on boosters, first stages, and upper stages that can be stored for years and ignited on demand with no propellant plumbing.",
